WEBVTT

01:27.745 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:47.705 --> 01:48.545
Madam.

01:50.105 --> 01:51.225
You cannot hold your drink.

01:53.105 --> 01:54.225
Do not drink any more.

02:02.345 --> 02:03.545
Yet he said

02:04.425 --> 02:06.705
she was the finest blessing
he ever gained.

02:10.225 --> 02:11.225
So this is it.

02:12.505 --> 02:14.385
I was never anything at all.

02:16.065 --> 02:17.745
Madam, you are truly drunk.

02:18.625 --> 02:19.545
Let me take you back to rest.

02:30.545 --> 02:31.385
Madam.

02:50.545 --> 02:51.905
When I was a child,

02:54.545 --> 02:57.105
there were days so bitter
I could hardly breathe,

02:58.305 --> 03:00.185
moments when I thought I could not go on.

03:04.465 --> 03:06.185
So I found a place

03:09.745 --> 03:11.145
and hid myself away.

03:17.265 --> 03:20.625
I hid for a long time,

03:22.465 --> 03:23.505
until

03:27.705 --> 03:29.385
he appeared.

03:31.185 --> 03:32.745
He took my hand

03:33.625 --> 03:34.985
and told me not to fear.

04:12.385 --> 04:14.865
You have been the light of my life.

04:17.905 --> 04:20.585
I have lived my whole life for you.

04:20.665 --> 04:23.025
Once, I wished to ask you:

04:23.545 --> 04:25.585
back then, did you truly mean to save me,

04:25.665 --> 04:27.985
or was I merely a piece on your board?

04:28.065 --> 04:30.145
Did you want me to believe

04:32.065 --> 04:34.105
that I owed you my life?

04:36.665 --> 04:37.865
But tell me,

04:39.065 --> 04:41.105
do I truly owe you anything?

04:41.705 --> 04:43.705
Do I truly owe you anything?

04:43.785 --> 04:46.425
Xiao Huan, do I truly owe you anything?

04:46.505 --> 04:48.465
Madam. Madam,

04:48.985 --> 04:50.385
you are truly drunk.

04:51.265 --> 04:52.425
Madam.

04:53.025 --> 04:55.145
I no longer care.

04:55.225 --> 04:57.985
Because the man who defiled my mother

04:58.865 --> 05:01.865
held an identity so exalted
she could never speak it aloud.

05:02.945 --> 05:05.145
They all said my mother was wanton,

05:05.225 --> 05:07.105
that she betrayed
the late Emperor's trust.

05:08.425 --> 05:11.105
They tied her to a stake

05:11.185 --> 05:13.185
and burned her alive.

05:13.985 --> 05:16.105
But whom did she truly betray?

05:16.185 --> 05:17.105
LET ME BEAR THE HEIR OF HIS MAJESTY

05:17.185 --> 05:18.865
My mother wrote a letter in her own blood.

05:23.785 --> 05:25.745
By then, the late Emperor was gone.

05:26.705 --> 05:28.625
Everyone wanted her dead.

05:35.465 --> 05:38.025
So she wrote this blood letter

05:38.105 --> 05:39.745
to prove who I was,

05:40.865 --> 05:43.025
hoping I might live to grow up safely.

05:43.905 --> 05:45.145
But she never knew

05:45.225 --> 05:47.385
that my identity would be concealed.

05:50.985 --> 05:52.345
It was you all

05:53.265 --> 05:54.745
who ruined my mother,

05:55.785 --> 05:56.705
ruined me,

05:57.545 --> 05:59.385
and left us unable to speak a word.

06:01.745 --> 06:03.945
What a fine imperial family.

06:04.465 --> 06:06.785
Such overwhelming majesty you wield.

06:08.305 --> 06:09.145
Madam,

06:09.665 --> 06:11.265
you must not say another word.

06:18.465 --> 06:20.385
Then tell me,

06:20.985 --> 06:23.665
what right do you have to pretend
to be the righteous one?

06:25.585 --> 06:28.025
Why did you deceive me
for more than ten years,

06:28.105 --> 06:32.185
and make me give everything,
pouring my whole life into repaying you?

06:33.105 --> 06:34.785
I am a princess as well.

06:36.865 --> 06:38.305
What you are entitled to,

06:39.225 --> 06:40.585
I am entitled to as well.

06:42.905 --> 06:44.905
Speak. Xiao Huan,

06:45.985 --> 06:47.665
say something.

06:47.745 --> 06:50.825
Can you not rise
and say at least one word?

06:51.345 --> 06:52.305
Madam,

06:52.905 --> 06:54.665
what is it you want me to say?

07:05.545 --> 07:06.425
You are right.

07:08.585 --> 07:10.065
No matter what you say,

07:11.545 --> 07:13.305
there is no path back for us.

07:16.225 --> 07:17.665
Aside from hating you,

07:19.025 --> 07:21.905
I have no other road left to walk.

07:34.665 --> 07:35.705
Xiao Huan,

07:37.905 --> 07:39.625
for my mother's death,

07:41.385 --> 07:43.145
I will have your Xiao clan repay it.

07:48.945 --> 07:51.465
YAOQING HALL

08:26.025 --> 08:27.545
Your Majesty, Your Majesty the Empress,

08:28.385 --> 08:31.425
Vice Commander Lu has safely escorted
the Imperial Father-in-law to Fayun Temple

08:31.505 --> 08:32.745
and settled him at Deer Courtyard.

08:33.425 --> 08:34.465
Good.

08:34.985 --> 08:36.545
See to his daily needs with utmost care,

08:37.144 --> 08:38.705
and let no one else disturb him.

08:39.664 --> 08:40.705
Yes.

08:45.545 --> 08:46.865
My thanks, Your Majesty.

08:47.585 --> 08:49.065
I only hope my father,

08:49.145 --> 08:51.465
while living in seclusion,

08:52.385 --> 08:53.225
may come to understand things clearly.

08:54.225 --> 08:56.825
In due time, when all has settled,

08:56.905 --> 08:58.505
you may still visit him.

08:58.585 --> 08:59.785
Deer Courtyard is not far.

09:31.905 --> 09:32.865
What do you mean?

09:33.945 --> 09:35.985
Yesterday I overheard something
I should not have heard.

09:38.585 --> 09:39.545
But rest assured, Madam.

09:40.425 --> 09:41.945
I have already checked the area.

09:42.945 --> 09:44.705
There were
no other palace servants present.

09:50.345 --> 09:52.145
You are to keep my secret forever,

09:53.985 --> 09:55.705
and yet why

09:57.865 --> 09:59.185
did you not kill yourself?

10:06.345 --> 10:07.465
Wait!

10:12.705 --> 10:14.665
Though there may be
some measure of performance to it,

10:15.505 --> 10:17.705
I am quite fond of this way

10:18.945 --> 10:19.945
of showing loyalty.

10:30.905 --> 10:32.505
Death will not be needed.

10:35.065 --> 10:36.425
I called you here,

10:36.945 --> 10:38.705
and drank myself senseless before you,

10:39.265 --> 10:41.145
because I had already decided.

10:43.065 --> 10:45.065
You are someone I can trust.

10:50.665 --> 10:53.025
I have studied the art of reading hearts
with His Majesty for years.

10:54.105 --> 10:55.705
A person's eyes

10:56.505 --> 10:58.185
never lie.

10:59.945 --> 11:01.705
Your eyes tell me

11:02.985 --> 11:06.105
you would live for me, and die for me.

11:07.105 --> 11:08.465
But what of it?

11:08.985 --> 11:10.945
In the end, you will never obtain

11:12.225 --> 11:13.425
my heart.

11:23.505 --> 11:25.145
To die for the Imperial Preceptor

11:25.225 --> 11:26.665
would be my greatest honor.

11:33.065 --> 11:34.705
I do not want you dead.

11:40.225 --> 11:41.785
I want you

11:42.625 --> 11:44.345
to live well for my sake.

11:54.065 --> 11:55.185
Your Majesty,

11:55.265 --> 11:56.545
Your Majesty the Empress,

11:58.825 --> 11:59.705
the Imperial Preceptor seeks audience.

12:03.905 --> 12:04.745
See to your duties first.

12:05.265 --> 12:06.705
I shall take my leave.

12:30.465 --> 12:31.865
Your Majesty, blessings upon you.

12:31.945 --> 12:32.785
WUYING HALL

12:34.865 --> 12:36.785
Are you bringing medicine for His Majesty?

12:38.585 --> 12:39.825
Indeed.

12:39.905 --> 12:41.625
His Majesty's foundation
was gravely injured before,

12:42.145 --> 12:43.945
and requires careful nurturing.

12:47.425 --> 12:48.785
It has been some time.

12:48.865 --> 12:50.385
You have grown much thinner.

12:51.665 --> 12:53.305
Your Highness is radiant,

12:53.385 --> 12:54.665
your elegance outshining pearls and jade.

12:54.745 --> 12:56.105
I can only feel ashamed in your presence.

12:58.025 --> 12:59.065
His Majesty awaits inside the hall.

12:59.145 --> 13:00.185
Please proceed.

13:01.425 --> 13:03.265
I respectfully see Your Highness off.

13:13.305 --> 13:15.945
PURE AND SPOTLESS

13:16.025 --> 13:17.625
Imperial Preceptor Du,
it has been quite some time.

13:18.145 --> 13:19.265
Indeed.

13:19.345 --> 13:22.825
I have not stepped into Wuying Hall
for one hundred and seventeen days.

13:25.425 --> 13:28.185
Why do you come personally today
to deliver the medicine?

13:40.385 --> 13:41.905
I have come first to deliver the medicine,

13:42.465 --> 13:44.225
and second to report to Your Majesty

13:45.145 --> 13:46.345
that I have thought things through.

13:47.025 --> 13:48.385
Thought through what?

13:48.985 --> 13:49.985
I acknowledge my faults.

13:51.385 --> 13:52.225
What fault do you speak of?

13:52.825 --> 13:55.185
My fault lies in overstepping,

13:55.265 --> 13:57.465
in lacking restraint,
and knowing no limits.

13:57.545 --> 13:59.385
Matters between
Your Majesty and Her Majesty

13:59.465 --> 14:00.825
are, in the end, your household affairs.

14:01.705 --> 14:03.065
Your Majesty is the Son of Heaven.

14:03.585 --> 14:05.345
Though Your Majesty bears the world
in your heart,

14:05.945 --> 14:07.385
you are still flesh and blood.

14:11.025 --> 14:12.625
As for the Jiangzhou matter,

14:12.705 --> 14:14.225
it was my narrow-mindedness.

14:16.665 --> 14:17.585
You overstate it.

14:18.345 --> 14:21.465
I should not have failed
Your Majesty's earnest expectations,

14:21.985 --> 14:23.585
nor betrayed Your Majesty's trust.

14:24.465 --> 14:25.305
Henceforth,

14:25.825 --> 14:27.345
I shall abide strictly by my station,

14:28.025 --> 14:30.345
and never again presume to judge
Your Majesty's family affairs.

14:33.105 --> 14:34.305
In my eyes,

14:34.825 --> 14:37.345
your sincerity matters
more than your remorse.

14:38.185 --> 14:41.025
If it is sincerity His Majesty desires,
I have brought it.

14:43.985 --> 14:45.345
Attend me. Present it.

15:02.345 --> 15:03.305
GREAT QI WATERWORKS MAP

15:08.225 --> 15:09.465
A waterworks map.

15:10.305 --> 15:11.585
You are indeed talented.

15:12.185 --> 15:14.505
Late summer and early autumn
in our dynasty often bring heavy floods.

15:15.185 --> 15:17.545
Even this year's locust plague is tied
to the flooding.

15:19.385 --> 15:21.905
I specially drafted this waterworks map

15:22.425 --> 15:24.105
for the Ministry of Works to examine.

15:31.145 --> 15:33.665
You even recorded
the tides of each passing year.

15:33.745 --> 15:34.665
You have been most diligent.

15:38.305 --> 15:40.665
Such matters should be addressed sooner
rather than later.

15:41.265 --> 15:43.065
Tell me, what do this
year's celestial signs reveal?

15:43.145 --> 15:44.385
Can we begin the works?

15:45.745 --> 15:48.105
I thank Your Majesty
for granting me another chance.

15:48.825 --> 15:50.905
I shall not disappoint Your Majesty.

15:52.625 --> 15:54.225
In my heart,

15:54.305 --> 15:56.305
Du Tingxin will always be Du Tingxin,

15:56.385 --> 15:58.065
meticulous in all you do.

16:04.545 --> 16:06.305
Your Majesty speaks truly.

16:07.105 --> 16:08.585
Whatever I set my mind to

16:09.105 --> 16:10.825
is always done with utmost precision.

16:16.065 --> 16:19.665
GREAT QI WATERWORKS MAP

16:19.745 --> 16:23.185
SHUTONG HALL

16:23.265 --> 16:24.185
Ying, look.

16:24.705 --> 16:26.585
I have prepared something for you.

16:26.665 --> 16:27.785
Your favorite dish.

16:27.865 --> 16:28.705
Come.

16:30.305 --> 16:32.185
Do not just stand there.
Eat while it is warm.

16:32.905 --> 16:33.945
Qianqing,

16:34.025 --> 16:36.865
tell me, are women with child
often without appetite,

16:36.945 --> 16:38.985
unable to stomach food or tea,

16:39.065 --> 16:40.185
and sleepless night after night?

16:41.145 --> 16:42.505
It is possible.

16:45.945 --> 16:47.665
Ying, why do you ask such a thing?

16:58.345 --> 17:00.625
Qianqing, I am with child.

17:04.704 --> 17:06.305
What… What did you say?

17:10.464 --> 17:11.265
Whose is it?

17:17.545 --> 17:18.745
Your Highness, you must not enter.

17:18.825 --> 17:19.665
Your Highness!

17:23.905 --> 17:24.944
Your Highness.

17:25.825 --> 17:27.025
You beast!

17:27.105 --> 17:28.505
-I will kill you!
-Stop!

17:29.185 --> 17:30.665
You storm Wuying Hall without cause.

17:30.745 --> 17:31.865
Xiao Qianqing.

17:31.945 --> 17:34.025
You had best give me one reason
not to punish you.

17:41.225 --> 17:42.065
Feng Wufu,

17:42.585 --> 17:43.905
step out first. Close the doors.

17:46.585 --> 17:48.545
-Go on.
-Yes.

17:57.225 --> 17:58.425
Ying is innocent of the world.

17:59.025 --> 18:00.905
This scoundrel dares bully her,

18:00.985 --> 18:01.905
making her…

18:03.785 --> 18:04.785
Making her with child.

18:06.265 --> 18:07.225
Impossible!

18:07.745 --> 18:09.065
I have remained pure with the Princess.

18:09.145 --> 18:09.985
How could she be with child?

18:10.065 --> 18:10.945
You dare deny it?

18:11.025 --> 18:12.225
She told me herself.

18:12.305 --> 18:13.665
If not you, then who else?

18:13.745 --> 18:15.025
-You must have taken advantage while…
-Enough.

18:17.745 --> 18:18.905
Li Hongqing is not such a man.

18:18.985 --> 18:20.585
Ying spoke it herself.

18:20.665 --> 18:22.785
She is simple and honest by nature.

18:22.865 --> 18:23.905
She would not lie.

18:28.145 --> 18:29.145
If such a thing is true,

18:29.225 --> 18:31.385
I am willing to offer my head.

18:41.345 --> 18:43.345
SHUTONG HALL

19:12.665 --> 19:13.505
Ying.

19:14.025 --> 19:15.945
Ying. How is it?

19:19.665 --> 19:20.745
The Imperial Physician said

19:21.585 --> 19:22.705
I am not with child.

19:28.425 --> 19:30.025
But Her Majesty said

19:30.545 --> 19:32.345
that I have love-sickness.

19:33.385 --> 19:34.185
Love-sickness?

19:38.905 --> 19:39.905
Ying,

19:41.225 --> 19:42.385
go on.

19:53.825 --> 19:55.025
Li Hongqing,

19:55.865 --> 19:57.905
I have not seen you
for seven days and ten hours.

19:58.625 --> 20:00.345
You have been on my mind ever since.

20:01.345 --> 20:03.265
I cannot eat or drink at all.

20:19.185 --> 20:20.065
Li Hongqing,

20:21.585 --> 20:23.105
I like you.

20:24.305 --> 20:26.065
I want to know,

20:26.665 --> 20:28.305
do you like me?

20:41.585 --> 20:42.585
What a pity.

20:43.105 --> 20:44.665
My straightforward and adorable sister

20:45.265 --> 20:47.785
ended up falling for
that blockhead Li Hongqing.

21:03.105 --> 21:04.385
I am terrified.

21:04.945 --> 21:06.105
I am unworthy of the Princess's regard.

21:13.425 --> 21:14.385
Terrified,

21:14.465 --> 21:15.745
and you still dare say you are terrified?

21:17.065 --> 21:18.225
Qianqing,

21:18.865 --> 21:20.425
he is the one I like.

21:20.505 --> 21:21.985
I forbid you to bully him.

21:35.065 --> 21:36.425
It came too suddenly.

21:36.505 --> 21:39.265
Hongqing, go back and think it over first.

21:39.345 --> 21:40.825
-There is no need to answer in haste.
-Yes.

21:45.825 --> 21:47.985
It is all right if you do not like me now.

21:48.625 --> 21:49.625
After all,

21:50.145 --> 21:51.905
you will like me sooner or later.

21:53.905 --> 21:55.465
If there is nothing else, Princess,

21:56.305 --> 21:57.425
please allow me to withdraw.

22:18.185 --> 22:20.545
Today, Ying did very well.

22:21.225 --> 22:22.265
You were very brave.

22:22.825 --> 22:23.785
Ying,

22:25.185 --> 22:27.425
come. Let us go in and eat something.

22:40.065 --> 22:41.705
He actually dared refuse my sister.

22:41.785 --> 22:43.025
Your Majesty, will you not intervene?

22:43.105 --> 22:44.985
So the Prince of Yuzhang means

22:45.065 --> 22:46.185
you wish me
to grant a marriage on the spot?

22:46.265 --> 22:47.785
Why not?

22:47.865 --> 22:50.105
Is my sister unworthy of that fool?

22:50.185 --> 22:52.865
A marriage must be of mutual affection.

22:52.945 --> 22:54.345
You and I cannot force
others simply by status.

22:55.945 --> 22:57.425
A forced match yields no joy.

22:58.025 --> 22:59.185
Take care of yourself.

23:06.985 --> 23:09.785
Yet what was once a forced match
between you and the Empress

23:09.865 --> 23:11.385
now seems quite sweet.

23:26.705 --> 23:27.545
Zhong Lin?

23:27.625 --> 23:28.625
Zhong Lin.

23:29.145 --> 23:30.065
Zhong Lin.

23:31.385 --> 23:32.865
Zhong Lin, it really is you.

23:35.545 --> 23:37.385
I could not find you for days.

23:37.465 --> 23:38.625
So you were hiding here.

23:38.705 --> 23:39.585
Why did you come?

23:40.905 --> 23:41.745
You still dare ask?

23:43.465 --> 23:46.705
You shared my bed,
and now you start avoiding me.

23:47.305 --> 23:49.465
If I hadn't come looking for you,

23:49.545 --> 23:50.545
would you really never
have come to me, even till death?

23:50.625 --> 23:52.425
What nonsense is that?
Who shared a bed with you?

23:52.505 --> 23:53.825
I was drunk.

23:53.905 --> 23:54.865
I remember nothing.

23:56.185 --> 23:58.625
Fine.
So now you pretend ignorance, do you?

23:58.705 --> 23:59.825
Stand still.

24:05.345 --> 24:07.145
This is abandoning me
after leading me astray.

24:07.225 --> 24:09.225
There was never a beginning.
How could I abandon anything?

24:13.545 --> 24:14.865
Never a beginning?

24:15.545 --> 24:17.025
Then all that happened between us…

24:20.745 --> 24:22.745
none of it counts?

24:30.465 --> 24:31.945
Zhong Lin. Zhong Lin,

24:32.025 --> 24:33.265
help me. It hurts.

24:33.985 --> 24:35.105
Stop acting.

24:35.625 --> 24:36.785
I will not fall for it.

24:36.865 --> 24:37.985
It truly hurts.

24:39.305 --> 24:40.185
What is it?

24:43.865 --> 24:44.945
What is it?

24:46.665 --> 24:47.985
It bit me.

24:48.585 --> 24:50.105
This is bad. You have been bitten
by a venomous scorpion.

24:50.185 --> 24:51.825
It is the Nanyi venom-scorpion.

24:52.345 --> 24:53.785
Fortunately, its venom is not fatal.

24:55.865 --> 24:57.865
But its venom will cause hallucinations.

24:59.185 --> 25:00.705
-Hallucinations?
-Enough.

25:01.465 --> 25:02.665
I will take you to sit up ahead.

25:02.745 --> 25:03.705
Come.

25:04.465 --> 25:05.745
Zhong Lin…

25:05.825 --> 25:06.865
Zhong Lin.

25:07.545 --> 25:08.825
Zhong Lin,

25:08.905 --> 25:09.865
I like you.

25:09.945 --> 25:11.865
I… I want to marry you.

25:17.825 --> 25:18.945
So fast.

25:19.545 --> 25:21.345
This venom truly works well.

25:21.945 --> 25:22.945
Tell me,

25:23.465 --> 25:25.625
do you like me too? Do you?

25:26.145 --> 25:28.105
-Do you?
-Yes.

25:28.185 --> 25:29.425
-Do you?
-Yes.

25:29.505 --> 25:30.345
Yes.

25:31.265 --> 25:32.985
I knew you liked me too.

25:33.505 --> 25:35.745
You would never abandon me.

25:35.825 --> 25:38.185
Right. I will not abandon you.

25:41.505 --> 25:43.665
-And then?
-That is all.

25:56.945 --> 25:58.065
You are unharmed.

25:59.705 --> 26:02.145
I… I was never bitten at all.

26:02.905 --> 26:03.985
You…

26:04.865 --> 26:06.825
But everything I said just now was true.

26:07.345 --> 26:08.745
Are you mad?

26:08.825 --> 26:10.225
Zhong Lin, I am not mad.

26:10.305 --> 26:11.905
I like you. I wish to marry you.

26:12.425 --> 26:14.025
You admitted it just now.

26:14.105 --> 26:15.265
You like me too.

26:15.345 --> 26:16.345
You cannot deny it.

26:17.505 --> 26:19.465
Do you know what kind of person I am?

26:19.545 --> 26:20.705
Of course I know.

26:24.905 --> 26:25.745
You saw it.

26:25.825 --> 26:28.825
I have survived
only by these crooked tricks.

26:29.985 --> 26:31.705
Because I am of the Lingbi Sect.

26:32.305 --> 26:33.505
So, Your Highness,

26:33.585 --> 26:35.545
please do not make
such senseless jokes again.

26:36.745 --> 26:37.625
I do not like it.

26:38.465 --> 26:39.865
I was not jesting.

26:44.705 --> 26:45.545
I was sincere.

26:49.425 --> 26:50.665
You have already feigned death

26:50.745 --> 26:52.225
and escaped the Lingbi Sect.

26:52.825 --> 26:54.785
You are now under my protection.

27:06.185 --> 27:07.185
It is useless.

27:09.785 --> 27:12.025
From the day I joined the Lingbi Sect,

27:12.945 --> 27:14.505
I was afflicted with Heartbane.

27:15.265 --> 27:17.185
This poison has fused with my blood.

27:17.265 --> 27:19.185
As long as the Heartbane Bell rings,

27:19.265 --> 27:20.625
the poison will erupt.

27:21.225 --> 27:24.385
I have tried hundreds of antidotes.

27:24.905 --> 27:27.545
But this poison has no cure at all.

27:35.145 --> 27:36.625
So, Xiao Qianqing,

27:38.545 --> 27:40.905
I will live my entire life in fear.

27:41.705 --> 27:43.225
Startled at the slightest sound,

27:43.745 --> 27:45.025
haunted by shadows,

27:46.305 --> 27:48.305
even the sound
of a copper bell terrifies me,

27:48.385 --> 27:50.745
for fear the Heartbane may erupt.

27:56.585 --> 27:58.265
This is the kind of person I am.

27:59.785 --> 28:01.385
Someone like me,

28:03.705 --> 28:05.025
would you still marry?

28:22.545 --> 28:25.705
Do you truly feel nothing
for Princess Ying?

28:27.345 --> 28:29.145
I am terrified.
I would never be presumptuous.

28:29.225 --> 28:31.025
Set aside your terror.

28:31.105 --> 28:32.465
Set aside her rank as Princess.

28:33.345 --> 28:34.705
You, Li Hongqing,

28:35.305 --> 28:37.785
toward Xiao Ying, do you truly feel
not even the slightest affection?

28:44.305 --> 28:46.665
It seems even
you are not entirely certain.

28:50.025 --> 28:52.265
My sister has a willful temper.

28:52.785 --> 28:54.385
She loves and hates with extremity.

28:54.465 --> 28:56.345
If you are uncertain,

28:56.425 --> 28:57.585
you must not provoke her.

28:59.505 --> 29:01.305
But if you are certain,

29:01.385 --> 29:02.545
I have no objection.

29:03.545 --> 29:04.625
I understand.

29:05.145 --> 29:07.585
For now, I will not see Princess Ying.

29:08.505 --> 29:10.145
Not until I am certain of myself.

29:12.305 --> 29:13.185
Good.

29:20.625 --> 29:23.225
Mother, I wish to marry Zhong Lin.

29:23.305 --> 29:25.505
I hope Mother will grant her blessing.

29:28.425 --> 29:30.545
On ordinary days
you may fool around all you like,

29:31.745 --> 29:33.745
but you must never marry Zhong Lin.

29:36.305 --> 29:37.905
What if I insist?

29:50.225 --> 29:51.145
Release me.

30:10.545 --> 30:13.065
The Empress Dowager has heard
that Miss Zhong excels in calligraphy.

30:13.585 --> 30:15.585
She has summoned you into the palace

30:15.665 --> 30:17.105
to witness your skill.

30:17.185 --> 30:19.185
Summoning me into the palace?

30:19.705 --> 30:21.105
It is clearly a scheme.

30:26.985 --> 30:29.025
My thanks for Her Majesty's favor.

30:29.825 --> 30:31.065
However,

30:31.145 --> 30:33.345
I was brought here too hastily.

30:33.425 --> 30:36.425
I did not bring
my beloved Sanhua Purple-Haired Brush.

30:36.505 --> 30:37.705
I shall return to retrieve it.

30:38.305 --> 30:39.785
Sanhua Purple-Haired?

30:41.385 --> 30:42.465
There is one here as well.

30:49.865 --> 30:50.865
I have another quirk.

30:51.625 --> 30:53.945
Before I put brush to paper,

30:54.025 --> 30:56.665
I must drink two cups of
the Sangluo Wine I brew myself.

30:56.745 --> 30:59.345
Unless Miss Zhong finishes
copying these scriptures,

31:00.425 --> 31:02.465
this servant cannot allow you to leave.

31:11.625 --> 31:12.945
Good aunt,

31:13.745 --> 31:16.585
if the Prince of Yuzhang learns
that I have gone missing,

31:17.345 --> 31:18.745
he will certainly come seeking me.

31:19.985 --> 31:21.545
Can you bear the consequence?

31:24.865 --> 31:28.425
The Prince of Yuzhang
is taking supper with the Empress Dowager.

31:28.945 --> 31:31.145
He may remain in the palace tonight.

31:31.745 --> 31:33.025
I fear

31:33.585 --> 31:34.625
he will not be thinking of you.

31:36.705 --> 31:37.625
Please proceed.

32:01.105 --> 32:04.825
WRITING

33:00.345 --> 33:02.505
Such petty tricks,

33:02.585 --> 33:03.905
and you think you can deal with me?

33:08.225 --> 33:09.185
Your Majesty.

33:09.785 --> 33:11.505
Your Majesty, please spare me.

33:11.585 --> 33:12.625
It was this woman.

33:12.705 --> 33:13.745
She seduced me!

33:16.705 --> 33:18.985
She is mine. You dare touch her?

33:20.465 --> 33:21.585
Qing,

33:21.665 --> 33:23.265
this vile woman

33:23.345 --> 33:24.505
conducted indecent acts

33:24.585 --> 33:26.105
in my own chambers,

33:26.185 --> 33:27.505
yet you defend her?

33:27.585 --> 33:28.465
Mother,

33:29.785 --> 33:31.425
these palace ploys…

33:32.305 --> 33:33.945
Are you certain you wish to use them
on your own son?

34:00.945 --> 34:02.745
WUYING HALL

34:06.865 --> 34:08.545
I seek to marry Zhong Lin

34:09.185 --> 34:10.465
and beg Your Majesty
to grant the marriage.

34:13.344 --> 34:14.705
PURE AND SPOTLESS

34:14.784 --> 34:16.744
Xiao Qianqing, have you gone mad?

34:18.065 --> 34:20.145
A woman of unknown origin,

34:20.225 --> 34:22.105
with her virtue in doubt.

34:22.985 --> 34:24.625
You would make her your princess?

34:26.945 --> 34:28.385
Mother speaks ill of Zhong Lin,

34:29.105 --> 34:32.025
yet do you know
that in the many times I was trapped,

34:32.625 --> 34:34.225
my life hanging by a thread,

34:35.625 --> 34:38.225
it was she who risked everything
again and again to save me.

34:39.784 --> 34:41.465
There are countless fine women
in this world,

34:42.145 --> 34:43.344
but in my heart,

34:43.425 --> 34:46.025
none compare
to Zhong Lin's courage and loyalty.

34:46.105 --> 34:47.344
Her devotion runs true.

34:52.185 --> 34:53.505
In this lifetime,

34:54.105 --> 34:54.905
I will marry no one but her.

35:04.305 --> 35:06.385
I will never allow you to wed

35:07.145 --> 35:09.025
a lowborn girl of the martial world.

35:09.745 --> 35:10.985
Especially one

35:11.545 --> 35:14.305
versed in crooked and unorthodox ways.
She is not a maiden of proper lineage.

35:15.065 --> 35:16.105
Put this thought out of your mind.

35:27.705 --> 35:28.905
The Empress Dowager speaks truly.

35:30.785 --> 35:32.585
According to the rites of Great Qi,

35:32.665 --> 35:36.025
Zhong Lin's status indeed forbids her
from becoming Princess of Yuzhang.

35:43.825 --> 35:45.505
But Zhong Lin's heart is upright,

35:46.105 --> 35:48.345
and she journeyed a thousand li
to resolve Xuzhou's plight.

35:49.265 --> 35:51.745
She also retrieved Frost Blossom
with the Prince of Yuzhang,

35:51.825 --> 35:54.545
which counts as service
in protecting the throne.

35:54.625 --> 35:55.865
She deserves a reward.

35:56.705 --> 35:57.945
Therefore,

35:58.025 --> 35:59.825
today I decree

36:00.345 --> 36:02.185
that Zhong Lin be granted the title
Princess of Ding'an,

36:03.025 --> 36:04.625
and this shall be proclaimed to all.

36:12.665 --> 36:13.705
Zhong Lin,

36:14.345 --> 36:15.425
from this day on,

36:15.505 --> 36:17.265
His Majesty and I are your family.

36:18.025 --> 36:21.265
If anyone dares wrong you again,
causing you grievance,

36:21.345 --> 36:23.225
we shall uphold justice for you.

36:25.945 --> 36:27.585
I, Zhong Lin, thank Your Majesty

36:27.665 --> 36:28.985
and Her Majesty the Empress.

36:33.305 --> 36:34.185
Rise.

36:39.465 --> 36:40.625
Zhong Lin,

36:40.705 --> 36:42.465
as for you and the Prince of Yuzhang,

36:42.545 --> 36:44.425
you need only follow your true heart.

36:45.065 --> 36:46.305
I ask you,

36:46.905 --> 36:48.865
are you willing to marry
the Prince of Yuzhang?

36:58.865 --> 37:01.305
Your Majesty, I am willing.

37:05.505 --> 37:08.185
Thank
Your Majesty for this marriage decree.

38:06.545 --> 38:07.785
What is it?

38:10.945 --> 38:11.785
Zhong Lin.

38:12.305 --> 38:14.465
The marriage bestowed by
His Majesty and Her Majesty,

38:14.985 --> 38:15.945
you agreed to it yourself.

38:16.545 --> 38:17.505
You are not allowed to go back on it.

38:27.345 --> 38:28.625
Xiao Qianqing.

38:29.425 --> 38:31.945
-Are you serious about me?
-Of course.

38:32.665 --> 38:33.505
You are not teasing you?

38:35.865 --> 38:37.785
Then is it because you pity me?

38:38.385 --> 38:40.025
Otherwise I truly cannot understand.

38:40.625 --> 38:41.865
You are the Prince of Yuzhang,

38:41.945 --> 38:43.705
noble in status, lacking in nothing.

38:43.785 --> 38:45.825
How could you
possibly like someone like me?

38:45.905 --> 38:46.825
What's wrong with liking you?

39:01.745 --> 39:02.625
Zhong Lin.

39:03.545 --> 39:04.385
I know.

39:05.585 --> 39:08.305
You and I have both wandered without rest.

39:08.385 --> 39:10.065
But now that we have each other,

39:10.745 --> 39:13.705
our hearts can finally find peace
for the future.

39:21.945 --> 39:23.425
I do not care who you are.

39:24.225 --> 39:25.985
I only want you to know

39:26.505 --> 39:29.545
that to me, Xiao Qianqing,
you are the woman I love most.

39:32.425 --> 39:33.705
I like you.

39:34.225 --> 39:36.825
And I never once thought
I would be able to marry you.

39:37.865 --> 39:39.665
I am truly very happy.

39:53.985 --> 39:54.905
Zhong Lin.

39:55.745 --> 39:57.185
There is something
I have long wanted to ask you.

39:59.065 --> 40:01.745
Why do you treat Ling Cangcang
differently from others?

40:07.225 --> 40:09.145
Perhaps because

40:09.745 --> 40:11.105
from childhood until now,

40:11.945 --> 40:14.505
she was the only one
who ever wished to protect me.

40:18.145 --> 40:19.425
Where are you taking me?

40:19.505 --> 40:20.985
Today is your birthday.

40:21.065 --> 40:22.865
I prepared a surprise for you.

40:24.425 --> 40:25.625
Is it beautiful?

40:25.705 --> 40:28.505
They say a mountain spirit dwells
within this wishing tree.

40:28.585 --> 40:30.505
As long as you make a wish,
it will come true.

40:31.185 --> 40:33.145
Zhong Lin, hurry and make a wish.

40:38.265 --> 40:39.465
I know I was wrong.

40:39.545 --> 40:42.505
Do not hit me.

40:51.185 --> 40:52.665
Do not hit me.

41:15.025 --> 41:18.345
Zhong Lin.
I only wanted to give you a surprise.

41:18.865 --> 41:20.385
Forgive me, Zhong Lin.

41:23.305 --> 41:25.465
No, Cangcang.
I should be the one thanking you.

41:26.425 --> 41:28.225
Cangcang. I want to make a wish.

41:28.905 --> 41:30.585
All right. What is it?

41:30.665 --> 41:32.705
I want to be your friend for life,

41:32.785 --> 41:34.625
to treat each other sincerely,
never to part.

41:34.705 --> 41:36.145
It is a promise.

41:36.225 --> 41:38.025
Then today let us swear sisterhood.

41:38.105 --> 41:39.985
Let this tree bear witness.

41:40.065 --> 41:40.905
Very well.

41:43.105 --> 41:44.665
Let the wishing tree bear witness.

41:44.745 --> 41:45.625
Today,

41:45.705 --> 41:47.305
-Ling Cangcang,
-Zhong Lin,

41:47.825 --> 41:49.745
form a bond of sisterhood.

41:49.825 --> 41:51.545
From this day on,

41:51.625 --> 41:54.585
we shall share
blessings and hardships alike,

41:54.665 --> 41:56.385
travel the ends of the earth together,

41:56.465 --> 41:57.825
and never betray each other.

42:01.145 --> 42:02.665
From then on,

42:02.745 --> 42:05.505
we became sworn sisters,
inseparable ever since.

42:06.465 --> 42:09.185
So she cut down all those bells for you,

42:09.265 --> 42:10.305
without question.

42:11.265 --> 42:12.345
Touched, aren't you?

42:13.465 --> 42:14.705
I understand.

42:28.225 --> 42:29.385
Commander Li.

42:29.465 --> 42:30.505
Commander Li.

42:33.225 --> 42:34.825
I saw the dark circles
under your eyes lately

42:34.905 --> 42:36.265
and worried you were not sleeping well.

42:36.345 --> 42:38.745
So I made this calming sachet for you.

42:40.865 --> 42:42.665
It is a small token of my regard.

42:42.745 --> 42:45.145
Commander Li, please accept it.

42:45.665 --> 42:46.905
Do not accept it!

42:54.025 --> 42:54.865
Your Highness.

43:05.025 --> 43:06.065
Your Highness!

43:32.625 --> 43:34.665
Is it because of her
that you do not like me?
